  <div class="card__content">
    
          <h3 class="card__title">
        <a href="/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cleanliness-helps-prevent">Cleanliness Helps Prevent Foodborne Illness</a>      </h3>
    
    
    <div class="card__teaser">Cleanliness is a major factor in preventing foodborne illness. Washing hands with warm water and soap for at least 20 seconds can help eliminate germs from your hands.</div>

          <div class="card__button">  
  <a href="/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cleanliness-helps-prevent" class="button button--arrow">Learn More</a>

</div>
      </div>

  </div>

              
  

