  <div class="card__content">
    
          <h3 class="card__title">
        <a href="/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/leftovers-and-food-safety">Leftovers and Food Safety</a>      </h3>
    
    
    <div class="card__teaser">Handle leftovers with care: make sure the food is cooked to a safe temperature and refrigerate any leftovers promptly.</div>

          <div class="card__button">  
  <a href="/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/leftovers-and-food-safety" class="button button--arrow">Learn More</a>

